# one safety guard. `old` must occur in `file` (nth occurrence, default the
# only one); `new` replaces it. cat: guard category. risk: S(ecurity),
# D(ata loss), E(xposure via NFS), I(dempotency/correctness), V(alidation).
# conc=True: the guard is in code other builders are editing right now.

